## **HubBase*Utility*** - It is used in [HubBase](https://github.com/HubBase-Authority/HubBase) as a utility manager.
| Project | Role |
| --- | --- |
| HubBase | The Main launcher. |
| HubBasePE | 5 additional programms. |
| HubBaseJE | The JavaScript port of HubBase |
| HubBaseUnified | The Unified launcher |
| **HubBaseUtility** | *The Utility programs* |

